 between require  mutagens of whatever color they lie  between as well as the surrounding  mutations here are two of my favourite  mutations from blood and wine in action  first let's check out deadly counter  sword attacks deal extra damage and if  the attackers vitality is under 25% the  counter attack is automatically a  finisher  taken for the right alright enough of  that let's check out my favorite  piercing cold this is a variation on art  that can freeze opponents as is it's not  as much of a spectacle so I'd suggest  leveling up in equipping art sweep and  far-reaching art these are only two of  the twelve new mutations and as you  unlock more you also unlock more slots  to equip new perks if you have any tips  or combinations you like to rock with  these new skills let us know in the  comments below and if you want to geek  out about Witcher lore feel free to hit  me up on Twitter at Jacob deck and for  all you witches out there good luck on  the path  you
 

